        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What's inside -->
    <section class="pq-section pq-inside">
      <h2>What's inside</h2>
      <div class="pq-inside-grid">
        <div class="pq-inside-card pq-inside-card-wide">
          <svg class="pq-inside-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20 6 C13 6 8 11.5 8 18 C8 27 20 36 20 36 C20 36 32 27 32 18 C32 11.5 27 6 20 6 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6" />
            <circle cx="20" cy="18" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" opacity="0.9" />
          </svg>
          <h3>Track all 63 parks</h3>
          <p>Every U.S. national park on one map or list, filtered by status, location, activities, or topics &mdash; backed by live NPS data and per-park weather.</p>
          <span class="pq-inside-stat">63 parks &middot; live NPS data</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pq-inside-card">
          <svg class="pq-inside-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="9" y="6" width="22" height="28" rx="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.5" />
            <path d="M15 6 h10 v3 a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 -1.5 1.5 h-7 a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 -1.5 -1.5 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.6" />
            <path d="M14 20 l3.5 3.5 L27 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" opacity="0.9" />
            <line x1="14" y1="28" x2="26" y2="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.5" />
          </svg>
          <h3>Log a real visit</h3>
          <p>A guided flow through trip dates, weather conditions, activities and topics, and a 5-star rating &mdash; not just a checkbox.</p>
          <span class="pq-inside-stat">multi-step log flow</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pq-inside-card">
          <svg class="pq-inside-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 30 L13 16 L19 24 L24 14 L35 30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" opacity="0.8" />
            <path d="M5 30 L35 30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.4" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="14" r="2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8" />
          </svg>
          <h3>GPX-powered hike stats</h3>
          <p>Upload a GPX file and it's parsed automatically into distance, elevation gain, and the route drawn on the map.</p>
          <span class="pq-inside-stat">distance &middot; elevation &middot; route</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pq-inside-card">
          <svg class="pq-inside-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="7" y="9" width="26" height="22" rx="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.5" />
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="28" y2="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.5" />
            <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="24" y2="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.5" />
            <path d="M29 20 v9 l-3 -2.2 l-3 2.2 v-9 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.9" />
          </svg>
          <h3>Bucket list</h3>
          <p>Queue up parks you want to see next and turn "someday" into an actual itinerary.</p>
          <span class="pq-inside-stat">save for later</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pq-inside-card">
          <svg class="pq-inside-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2 3" />
